# Source PNGs for the three class hero images, superseded by the .webp beside
# them. 6.97MB -> 422KB (93% smaller) with no visible quality loss, and these
# load on the home screen and the app-shell background, so it came straight off
# every player's first paint. Kept on disk as the masters to re-export from.
apps/web/public/characters/Berserkers.png
apps/web/public/characters/Sentinel.png
apps/web/public/characters/Phanthom.png

# ── Private docs: kept locally, deliberately not published ───────────────────
# Untracked 2026-08-03. These stay on disk and out of the repository.
#
# Grant and strategy material. GRANT_EVIDENCE.md in particular contains candid
# internal assessments ("THIS IS WRONG" against a milestone marked complete),
# written as honest bookkeeping but readable by a grant committee as coaching on
# how to present numbers. ONCHAIN_TRANSACTIONS.md describes where new on-chain
# volume could come from "for grant reporting", which reads as gaming the metric
# whatever the intent was.
docs/GRANT_EVIDENCE.md
docs/ONCHAIN_TRANSACTIONS.md
docs/LITEPAPER.md
docs/EDITIONS_ROADMAP.md
docs/C5_SHIP_GATE.md
docs/B0_ECONOMY_DEPLOY.md

# Deployment runbooks. Not secret, but they describe the infrastructure.
docs/CAPACITOR.md
docs/RAILWAY_MIGRATION.md

# ── Unreferenced art, kept locally ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Untracked 2026-08-03. Still on disk; nothing was deleted.
#
# Four landing-page PNGs no source file loads — the landing page uses the .webp
# versions and the "Valor Characters" folder, both of which ARE referenced and
# stay tracked. Verified by grepping for each filename AND its URL-encoded form,
# which matters here: LandingPage.tsx refers to "Valor%20Characters", so a naive
# search for the literal name reports it unused when it is not.
apps/web/public/characters/Valor Landing Page.png
apps/web/public/characters/Phanthom male and female.png
apps/web/public/characters/Sentinel male and female.png
apps/web/public/characters/Charcters for landing page.png

# @capacitor/assets SOURCE images (22 MB). A CLI consumes these to generate the
# native icon and splash sets, which are themselves committed under ios/ and
# android/. Nothing serves them and no web build reads them. Needed on disk only
# when regenerating native assets.
apps/web/assets/
